# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## Common Commands

```bash
# Run the application
mvn spring-boot:run

# Build (skip tests)
mvn clean package -DskipTests

# Run all tests
mvn test

# Run a single test class
mvn test -Dtest=ClassName

# Run a single test method
mvn test -Dtest=ClassName#methodName
```

The app runs on **port 8082**. Database config is loaded from `src/main/resources/env.properties`.

## Architecture

Spring Boot 4.0.5 REST API with a standard layered architecture:

```
Controller → Service → Repository → Entity
```

DTOs are used for all API request/response contracts to decouple the API surface from JPA entities.

### Domain Model

Hierarchical location structure:

```
Country → State → City → Restaurant
```

`Employee` has a `ManyToMany` relationship with `Restaurant` (join table: `employee_restaurants`).

### Packages (`com.nortcali.api`)

| Package | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `controller/` | REST endpoints — one controller per entity |
| `entity/` | JPA entities (Employee, Country, State, City, Restaurant) |
| `dto/` | Request/Response DTOs per entity |
| `repository/` | Spring Data JPA repositories |
| `service/` | `EmployeeDetailsService` implements `UserDetailsService` for Spring Security |
| `config/` | `SecurityConfig`, `JwtAuthFilter`, `CorsConfig` |
| `security/` | `JwtUtil` (HMAC-SHA256 token generation/validation) |

### Security

- All endpoints require JWT authentication except `/api/auth/**`
- Login via `POST /api/auth/login` returns a Bearer token (24h expiry)
- Sessions are stateless; JWT is validated per-request in `JwtAuthFilter`
- CORS is configured to allow `http://localhost:5173` (frontend dev server)

### Database

- MySQL 8 at `localhost:3306/nortcali`
- Hibernate DDL mode is `validate` — schema must exist before startup; Hibernate will not create/modify tables
- Credentials are in `src/main/resources/env.properties` (not committed — check `.gitignore`)
